00:10:23,184 --> 00:10:29,344
在订阅者方面，这个节点正在监听 ROS 主题，比如机器人状态、传感器数据。
On the subscribers, this node is listening for a ROS topic like robot status, sensor data.

99
00:10:29,582 --> 00:10:33,156
在这种情况下，它只是字符串格式的浮点数和布尔数据。
In this case, it's just float in string and boolean data.

100
00:10:33,614 --> 00:10:36,804
然后这些数据将显示在网页控制台屏幕上。
Then this data will be showing on the web console screen.

101
00:10:37,262 --> 00:10:43,184
所以在 ROS 回调中，我们会把 ROS 主题数据放入 send packets 对象的各个键中。
So in the ROS callback, we will put the ROS topic data to the send packets object in each key.

102
00:10:43,344 --> 00:10:52,452
在定时器循环中，我们持续监听来自 BUS Python 客户端的 UDP 接收套接字，
先用 pickle 加载一次，然后再用 JSON 加载。
Inside timer loop, we keep listening from UDP receive socket from the BUS Python client, load by pickle once, then load again by JSON.

103
00:10:52,814 --> 00:11:01,264
在传递数据时，我们会检查诸如时间戳、输入数字、pdvm 命令、按钮状态或速度指令等键。
Inside the pass data, we will check the key like timestamp, input number, pdvm command, button state, or command velocity.

104
00:11:01,486 --> 00:11:04,704
对于时间戳，我们只需将其打印出来，不做任何处理。
For timestamp, we just print it out and don't do anything.

105
00:11:05,102 --> 00:11:12,864
对于其他键，我们将把传递的数据放入每个 ROS 发布者中，
这样其他 ROS 节点就能看到这些输入指令了。
For other keys, we're going to put the pass data to each ROS publisher so the other ROS node could see this input command.

106
00:11:13,038 --> 00:11:20,260
最后，我们将 send packets 发回给 BUS Python 客户端，并进一步发送到 WebRTC。
Then lastly, we are sending out the send packets back to the BUS Python client and to the WebRTC further.

107
00:11:20,782 --> 00:11:24,132
这些是运行在机器人端的三个 Python 脚本。
Those are three Python scripts running on the robot side.

108
00:11:24,526 --> 00:11:32,304
对于信令服务器，这些注释部分是针对 HTTPS 的，下面的代码块是针对普通 HTTP 的。
For signaling server, these comment outlines are for HTTPS and lower block is just for normal HTTP.

109
00:11:32,942 --> 00:11:36,384
所以你可以注释掉上面的任何一个代码块，或者注释掉这个代码块。
So you can comment out either of the above block or this block.

110
00:11:36,544 --> 00:11:47,460
在连接事件中，如果客户端作为 offer 客户端连接，我们就把它设为 db US offer；
如果客户端是 answer 客户端，就把它设为 BUS answer。
On the connection even, if the client connects as offer client, then we put it
as db US offer, or if the client is answer client, then it put as the BUS answer.

111
00:11:48,110 --> 00:11:54,212
对于 answer 客户端，如果 offer 先到，它就会把接收到的 offer 发回给 answer。
For answer client, if offer come first, then it will send a receive offer back to answer.

112
00:11:54,606 --> 00:11:59,376
或者如果 answer 客户端先到，就只需将该标志设置为 answer 先到即可。
Or if answer client came first, then just set that flag as answer came first.

113
00:11:59,854 --> 00:12:07,396
在消息事件中，如果消息来自 offer 客户端，我们就检查它是 ping 消息还是 offer 消息。
On message even, if the message is from the offer client, then we check that it's a ping message or offer message.

114
00:12:07,982 --> 00:12:13,380
如果设置了 answer 先到，我们就立即把 offer 发回给 answer。
And in case the answer comes first is set, then we send the offer back to answer immediately.

115
00:12:14,062 --> 00:12:21,412
但如果消息来自 answer 客户端且 offer 已经到了，我们就把 answer 发回给 offer 客户端。
But if the message is from answer client and offer is already here, then we send answer back to the offer client.

116
00:12:22,094 --> 00:12:29,124
在关闭事件中，如果 offer 客户端关闭，就将其设为当前时间并关闭 WebSocket。
On close event, if the offer client is closed then just set it as now and close the web socket.

117
00:12:29,710 --> 00:12:33,696
类似地，如果 answer 客户端关闭，也将其设为当前时间。
Similar if the answer client is closed then just set it as now.

118
00:12:34,190 --> 00:12:42,976
但如果 offer 客户端还没关闭，它会把重启 offer 发回给 offer 客户端，
告知它 answer 客户端已经断开。
But if the offer client hasn't closed yet, it will send restart offer
back to offer client to let it know that the answer client is gone now.

119
00:12:43,214 --> 00:12:47,812
还有一个循环，就是为了检查在 offer 未正常关闭的情况。
And there is a loop just to check the in case of the offer is not closed properly.

120
00:12:48,206 --> 00:12:54,020
如果信令服务器收不到来自 offer 客户端的任何信息，它就会关闭所有的 WebSocket。
The signaling server will not receive anything from the offer client, then it will close all the web sockets.

121
00:12:54,336 --> 00:13:00,096
接下来，一旦 offer 对端启动，它就会启动 WebSocket 连接到信令服务器。
Next, once the offer peer is started, it will start WebSocket to connect with signaling server.

122
00:13:00,270 --> 00:13:03,376
所以它将从打开 offer.html 开始。
So it will start by open up offer.html.

123
00:13:03,536 --> 00:13:10,816
这个页面非常简单，只需导入 offer 和 main offer.js 脚本，只有一个显示视频的框。
This page is very simple, just import offer and main offer.js scripts and has only a video box showing.

124
00:13:10,976 --> 00:13:12,496
这是 offer.js。
Here is offer.js.

125
00:13:12,816 --> 00:13:15,856
我们在顶部定义了 WebRTC 变量。
We have defined WebRTC variables on top here.

126
00:13:16,110 --> 00:13:19,056
接下来，我们创建 WebSocket 作为 offer 客户端。
Next, we create WebSocket as offer client.

127
00:13:19,534 --> 00:13:23,300
所以我们需要指定信令服务器的 URL。
So we need to specify the URL of signaling server.

128
00:13:23,822 --> 00:13:29,188
之后，它还会启动一个 WebSocket 本地客户端作为 BOS 本地端。
After that, it will also start a WebSocket local client as the BOS local.

129
00:13:29,614 --> 00:13:33,136
这是为了与本地的 data server.py 进行通信。
This is to communicate with the local data server.py.

130
00:13:33,422 --> 00:13:36,772
所以我们需要取消注释这一行，以允许数据通信。
So we need to uncomment this to allow data communication.

131
00:13:37,294 --> 00:13:49,444
你可以看到在消息事件中，无论它从 BOS 本地 WebSocket 接收到什么，
它都会使用 WebRTC 数据通道将其进一步发送，这意味着数据将传递到 Web 控制台。
You could see on message event, whatever it received from the BOS local WebSocket, it will use WebRTC data channel to send it further,
meaning the data will be passed through to the web console.

132
00:13:50,158 --> 00:13:57,616
因为 offer 页面是在机器人端运行的，所以我们需要初始化摄像头或麦克风等媒体设备。
And because offer page is running on the robot side, we need to initialize the media device like camera or microphone.

133
00:13:57,776 --> 00:14:02,116
在代码中，其中的媒体设备会检查可用设备。
On the code, media device in it will check on the available devices.

134
00:14:02,606 --> 00:14:14,256
所以如果我想使用特定的摄像头，例如名称为 fake device 的，
那么我会检查每个设备的标签并返回正确的设备 ID。
So in case if I would like to use a specific camera, for example, with the name as fake device,
then I will check the label of each device and return the correct device ID.

135
00:14:14,542 --> 00:14:18,736
获取到摄像头的设备 ID 后，将其放入约束对象中。
After got device ID of camera, then put it as constraint object.

136
00:14:18,896 --> 00:14:25,936
如果没有麦克风，就把音频设为 false，然后我们可
以使用 getUserMedia 配合约束条件来打开摄像头。
If no microphone, then put audio as false, and we can use getUserMedia with the constraint to open the camera.

137
00:14:26,096 --> 00:14:28,016
最后，我们调用 create offer。
In the end, we call create offer.

138
00:14:28,336 --> 00:14:36,016
之后，create offer 将使用 SDP 数据，例如在 WebRTC 中将使用哪些媒体设备。
After that, create offer will be using an SDP data, for example, what media device will be used in WebRTC.

139
00:14:36,654 --> 00:14:43,936
在函数内部，它将创建 peer connection 并创建自己的 offer，然后发送到信令服务器。
Inside the function, it will create peer connection and create its own offer, then send to signaling server.

140
00:14:44,270 --> 00:14:51,812
对于 create peer connection 函数，它将使用提供
的 stun turn 服务器来创建 RTC peer connection。
For create peer connection function, it will create RTC peer connection by using provided stunt turn server.

141
00:14:52,366 --> 00:14:56,260
我们可以使用 Google 的免费服务器，也可以使用我们自己的。
We can use the free one from Google or we can use our own.

142
00:14:56,686 --> 00:14:58,416
所以只需在这里指定即可。
So just specify it here.

143
00:14:58,894 --> 00:15:01,220
对于本地测试，我们不需要指定它。
For local test, we don't need to specify it.

144
00:15:01,710 --> 00:15:11,456
然后如果有本地视频，我们会把它放在本地视频上，我们会
从本地流中获取轨道并将其添加到 peer connection 中。
Then if there is a limode video, we will put it on the local video and we're
going to get track from local stream and add track to the peer connection.

145
00:15:11,950 --> 00:15:13,796
接着创建数据通道。
Then data channel is created.

146
00:15:14,318 --> 00:15:21,376
如果从 WebRTC 数据通道收到消息，我们只需将其传递到 WS 本地 WebSocket。
And if there is message coming from WebRTC Data Channel, we just pass through it to the WS local web socket.

147
00:15:21,696 --> 00:15:32,816
最后，ICE 候选者（即 WebRTC 连接的优化路径）可能会更新，
我们希望将最新的 ICE 发送到信令服务器。
And at the end, the ICE candidate, which is the optimized path for WebRTC connection, could be updated,
and we would like to send the latest ICE to the signaling server.

148
00:15:33,102 --> 00:15:39,716
在这里的图表中，你可以看到 SDP 和更新后的 ICE 候选者都被发送到了信令服务器。
On the diagram here, you could see both of SDP and updated ICE candidate sent to the signaling server.

149
00:15:40,718 --> 00:15:48,292
所以一旦 Web 控制台或 answer peer 启动，它将作为
AnswerClient 通过 WebSocket 连接到信令服务器。
So once Web Console or answer peer is started, it will connect with Signaling Server by WebSocket as AnswerClient.

150
00:15:48,974 --> 00:15:53,828
在这里的代码中，我们需要确保信令服务器的 URL 是正确的。
On the code here, we need to make sure the URL of Signaling Server is correct.

151
00:15:54,478 --> 00:16:01,124
在消息事件中，如果消息是 alive，那应该是来自 offer 客户端的 offer。
On message event, if the message is alive, that is supposed to be an offer from offer client.

152
00:16:01,582 --> 00:16:08,932
然后如果创建的 answer 为 false，我们将运行 start connect，并稍微延迟 3 秒。
Then if created answer is false, we are going to run start connect with a bit delay of 3 seconds.

153
00:16:09,806 --> 00:16:11,984
下一步是创建回答。
Next step is to create answer.

154
00:16:12,590 --> 00:16:15,140
这个流程基本上和创建提议是一样的。
The sequence is pretty much same as offer.

155
00:16:15,630 --> 00:16:23,428
所以开始创建 peer 连接，生成它自己的 SDP 和 ICE，然后发回给信令服务器。
So start create peer connection and make its own SDP and Ice, then send it back to signaling server.

156
00:16:24,270 --> 00:16:30,084
在图示中，提议端会收到回答，然后将其添加到 peer 连接中。
On the diagram here, offer will receive answer, then it will add answer to peer connection.

157
00:16:30,574 --> 00:16:37,668
在回答端的创建 peer 连接中，只需像之前一样启动与服务器的 RTC peer 连接。
Inside create peer connection of answer, just start RTC peer connection with server, same as before.

158
00:16:38,126 --> 00:16:42,692
现在我们这里的远程流就是机器人的视频流。
Then now the remote stream we have here is the robot video streaming.

159
00:16:43,246 --> 00:16:49,984
我们将流放入机器人的视频源对象中，也就是网页控制台上的 DOM 元素。
We're going to put the stream to the robot video source object, which is the DOM element on the web console.

160
00:16:50,190 --> 00:16:55,204
在 DataChannel 上，我们将接收 WebRTC 数据的标志设置为 true。
On DataChannel, we set the flag as receive data web RTC as true.

161
00:16:55,886 --> 00:17:02,628
我们知道收到的消息是 JSON 对象，所以我们可以解析它并获取每个键对应的数据。
Then we know that the message coming is JSON object, so we can pass it and get data from each key.

162
00:17:03,118 --> 00:17:10,788
所以需要确保传递的键与这里 JSON ROS2 转换器发送数据包的键是一致的。
So need to make sure that the key are passing is same as the key of send packets from JSON ROS2 converter here.

163
00:17:11,534 --> 00:17:17,424
一旦 WebRTC 连接建立，这就是一个点对点的连接。
Once the WebRTC connection is established, this will be a through peer-to-peer connection.

164
00:17:17,678 --> 00:17:27,556
来自网页控制台的输入命令将从回答端发送到提议端，通过
机器人内部的本地 WebSocket 传递，并构建成 ROS 话题。
Input command from Web Console will be sent from answer to offer and pass
through local web socket inside the robot and construct as ROS topic.

165
00:17:27,824 --> 00:17:40,144
反之，机器人的数据或传感器数据将从本地 WebSocket 发送到提议端，
然后通过 WebRTC 数据通道传到回答端，并在屏幕上显示。
Vice versa, the robot's data or sensor data will be sent from local web socket to offer,
then pass through answer via WebRTC data channel and display on screen.

